  "figure": {
    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>time-window-filter-classify · 6×1×1 workgroups × 256×1×1 lanes = 1536 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-dataframe-time-window-filter-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect><rect x=\"21\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"41\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"61\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"3\"></rect><rect x=\"81\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"4\"></rect><rect x=\"101\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"5\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 256\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-dataframe-time-window-filter-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"256\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"8\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const paramsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; params: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const startHighOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; startHigh: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const startLowOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read&gt; startLow: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const outputMaskOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"12\">@group(0) @binding(3) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; outputMask: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"14\">// Double-single difference (aHigh + aLow) - (bHigh + bLow). High parts are subtracted first so\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">// nearby large epoch values cancel exactly before the small low parts are added. The result is\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">// used for fade and clip ratios, where rounding is harmless.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">fn timeDifference(aHigh: f32, aLow: f32, bHigh: f32, bLow: f32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">  return (aHigh - bHigh) + (aLow - bLow);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">// Exact double-single a &gt;= b. Backends with fast-math may reassociate the sum above and drop the\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">// low parts, so acceptance compares the high parts first and uses the low parts only on ties.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">fn isTimeAtLeast(aHigh: f32, aLow: f32, bHigh: f32, bLow: f32) -&gt; bool {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">  return aHigh &gt; bHigh || (aHigh == bHigh &amp;&amp; aLow &gt;= bLow);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"27\">@compute @workgroup_size(256)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"28\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">  _ = &amp;params;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">  _ = &amp;startHigh;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">  _ = &amp;startLow;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">  _ = &amp;outputMask;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 16777216u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 256u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">  if (index &gt;= INVOCATION_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">    return;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">  \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">  let windowStartHigh = params[paramsOffset + 0u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">  let windowStartLow = params[paramsOffset + 1u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">  let windowEndHigh = params[paramsOffset + 2u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">  let windowEndLow = params[paramsOffset + 3u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">  let startFade = params[paramsOffset + 4u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">  let endFade = params[paramsOffset + 5u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">  let rowStartHigh = startHigh[startHighOffset + index];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">  let rowStartLow = startLow[startLowOffset + index];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">  let rowEndHigh = rowStartHigh;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">  let rowEndLow = rowStartLow;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">  // Ordered comparisons are false for NaN, so NaN rows are rejected. A reversed window\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">  // (end &lt; start) accepts nothing, interval rows included (B-13).\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"60\">  let endAfterWindowStart = timeDifference(rowEndHigh, rowEndLow, windowStartHigh, windowStartLow);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">  let startBeforeWindowEnd = timeDifference(windowEndHigh, windowEndLow, rowStartHigh, rowStartLow);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"62\">  let accepted =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"63\">    isTimeAtLeast(windowEndHigh, windowEndLow, windowStartHigh, windowStartLow) &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"64\">    isTimeAtLeast(rowEndHigh, rowEndLow, windowStartHigh, windowStartLow) &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"65\">    isTimeAtLeast(windowEndHigh, windowEndLow, rowStartHigh, rowStartLow);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"66\">  outputMask[outputMaskOffset + index] = select(0u, 1u, accepted);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"67\">  \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"68\">  \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"69\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>params<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"time-window\">time-window</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>startHigh<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"timestamps\">timestamps</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>startLow<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"timestampsLow\">timestampsLow</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>outputMask<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"outputMask\">outputMask</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPUTimeWindowFilter/classify · main · 19c874e3</figcaption></figure></section>",
